    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12433104/comment/12743355",
          "id": "12743355",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "body": "The patch introduces a boolean property enwikiQueryMaker.disableSpanQueries. If it is set to true (default is false), EnwikiQueryMaker doesn't make SpanQueries.\n\nresults (elapsedSec) are:\n\n|| ||FastVectorHL||HL||\n|w/o patch|7.70|20.25|\n|w/ patch|7.67|19.07|",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "created": "2009-08-14T18:40:42.490+0000",
          "updated": "2009-08-14T18:40:42.490+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12433104/comment/12743535",
          "id": "12743535",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "body": "Because FastVectorHighlighter's strength is the performance when processing large docs, this patch includes:\n* set max.field.length Integer.MAX_VALUE in the alg file\n* introduces a new property \"highlighter.maxDocCharsToAnalyze\" and set it Integer.MAX_VALUE in the alg file\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "created": "2009-08-15T04:05:45.799+0000",
          "updated": "2009-08-15T04:05:45.799+0000"
        },
